-radius: 10px;" width="28" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;气候变化的影响不仅变得不可忽视，而且变得难以忍受。然而，随着领导人就所需变革的速度和规模争论不休，围绕气候行动的政治共识正在破裂。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;本周的&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;《零》&lt;/em&gt;节目中， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/iE_Z2opztNlOcIDUeHDmxWhHHPh1tAr5G4jJh0-zInw99qylZYCdkyMduEMaeqdilpkjzZ1Ny5a2HOVPNP9OUM6VElFb5_IhOAj6Vs2mDkraHsbtFmFldKpJJsXt_VWF3oMkWGhgLaAwNSM1Ta9YdeSNwGuDsUObXGsF4k0__EPLh2a_ElN1QKsTGSDn0VVPjDVwnvLAF4qif93ivhQ5wysOhAmUp8XTwXINd3GrZcV0PW3pc_4GGSZdx0dI0FSn3fxeIAHrenBEoiG1xmNRVC9TFpW4uny3DjJyBflMBE8I3IqB7iUCWrEneH0RQqoj_PxRHKqfncq-r-K_W3MyRAlR0lXoe4dymZqq7NW9b3kLXsd63oZZh660hW5rd1ojxSpyAZOgaN748JSJVh75R4JxlEGGxOblAyK5DMm-8m6XD7HmK2Svau1-hoIsSVn8GiovgoSKl_F5bKVdGH9MtWxascKKEHCIJFZbsyCduAwVlA/OuNFCtCEItY44Sf4p1ZACCgKCc9TyKEN/23?cmpid=BBD081526_GREENDAILY&amp;amp;utm_campaign=greendaily&amp;amp;utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_term=260815&amp;amp;utm_content=7730" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="Akshat Rathi - 高级记者：气候 |彭博社"&gt;阿克沙特·拉蒂 (Akshat Rathi)&lt;/a&gt;与英国绿党前党魁、担任议会议员 14 年的卡罗琳·卢卡斯 (Caroline Lucas) 进行了对话，讨论了气候变化对国家安全构成的日益严重的威胁，以及她在气候政治前线四十年的经验教训。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;立即收听，并在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/RLqfHEvhhuqxjxuIEAUnpa0Hpn9cVxUvpmE90bcJob7PK2uy4_YipgI8qh5m5DzMyw6TfYYgsnThOZrGjMkmM45oVtZFxsLf3H93ZNXvKLC3GdzdDfaFDNlZz5NkPIvOTSRXfLwNP4rWmx_6B8boWWM2WkLlOWkelT7C9ZehiN8SV8yzuzrjYI3zzCUcN_vKgsxUpX1nGcSmrCZVGuph7bMhbatYdvTBrNZ2GZHNIYoz4R28QsnXpICyzKjFNAUV0UnfOfWgDIzBXTzjvK42NwrqCR9UP0RTYqShkgywznwI7PLBjWMRJQ0NA94KR7hyg-HECA/wMIDbCkZlFk7PZmOSRIQySI5oqNv70IH/23?cmpid=BBD081526_GREENDAILY&amp;amp;utm_campaign=greendaily&amp;amp;utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_term=260815&amp;amp;utm_content=7730" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-siz