p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;随着美国的军火库因与伊朗的战争而耗尽，各公司正试图更快地更换昂贵的军备。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;三周前&lt;/strong&gt;，华尔街的赌场人群遭受了打击。人工智能股票暴跌，半导体股票暴跌，杠杆交易崩溃。现在，许多投机性交易&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/IsMa674kSU0ZM0z0yRd6_Ns3kzgohw-4laqrS-1Qu7rr527hwFKrO6fAsJ05GOYhBktTlRSux0Ii-wGGetbpgf_v5jhyx8Iq4uJaiFb8PB7tROzfRaP8tS11yJVD2bCBTtxa9talszkG50nQJpve2-VsGK_PQdNTf5if8uAiueAOtWUkIAxH3zb0LROdgaI1-y3FCkCM1eAWpxRxX2Vsngh88EP1xc8LqRqXTIg0Yv848wv5gfjmW6SHNvPHUTvAbzAitssGQ98OodcKoNQqcOxcCWpPUHCmA8fjYU7615mg56JJPTvTag3O865-9hvcH3px5jOOY1UGquik08BpblGg1J_ONpqpdC8wHDroMOoxCIlitzxJHmzHussmloRY6T_JcPYVA7Ze1PIjdL_79FgGtRXB0bhoopAMp6_6T-uQG9rw11E2L9hCyCqCk8Ms2ggrnAeXjlYMdpddV4WhlpJfqP6Ai8mK6hJsGeEdEclRCu9GlnfpF16NQxN_myBmWwKyGMI9EjzOEgjxddCO9A/s4zByzys8CJLyoi8oxvVvAllm8ACON1M/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="赌场人群铸造 500 亿美元，杠杆 ETF 反弹"&gt;正在以同样快的速度回升&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;新的资金正在流入杠杆交易所交易基金，而就在几周前，这些产品还成为散户投机过度的担忧焦点。看涨期权购买量激增，许多最近才受到惩罚的科技交易再次成为市场的最大赢家。 &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/5ZaMwMVz3LELYQUcT_QucU-xVPTmBfarTXptv7K-CkPFaaVNPC0jsE_RQZHwxMotzUgA0iQoiV4yolHy1LbXoagyjP3Lt9FT5OV0M9TCc7YlzbhXnE69GbgldnOlHjqJ_ppMt2nPEb6kwiGr4o3s8_xCgis80FmcW_DOEYVGns2Grt97h5D0uJMwvNdQ8nbLc1MXBeOoD3nbQnYOTJKzzPrgkEZwz9a2l4XGSQ4F84eLa4z_MYXAJzVfPr9LIH0yJYMdGfPzIl2de266FOD3zA6XzN-VqW9EYowZDFeMnyj2vveEujlf1rBfDILnhtCMO6MLNwXcFlfYk4AWy8Ns0K4jTZYGL9UMKL51RNYitgwDnYEJC94FP6Cl4sIV7y8R0S3qtFsJgleoFgd0zOuSr9aPwwe7-kP4iRSJmkyCG9qlRTuIVlnC4IaLeliQnxSwCeR61uAXsHtkoDJab66lOt08MUtqSoonLVh3Tq-z7hutST4sud5